{"product_id":"smok-solus-g-box-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Solus G-BOX Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eSMOK SOLUS G-BOX Kit features a 700mAh internal battery with max 20W output, compatible with a Solus refillable 0.9ohm pod cartridge that accommodates 2.5ml of vape juice. The 5-20W output range and the airflow draw-activity mode are suitable for the vaper who loves MTL or RDL vaping mode. The PCTG material ensures lightweight while making G-BOX more robust and durable. The pod designed with a magnet design for easy replacement helps to lock and can securely without loosening, making the coil heat quickly. It is equipped with a Type-C charging port that you can enjoy a nice flavor after only 15 minutes of charging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Solus g-box infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0615\/0343\/8900\/files\/smok-solus-g-box__2.jpg?v=1700522155\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSolus G-Box Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e700mAh Internal Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Range Of 5-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2.5ml Vape Juice Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and Easy-to-use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAir Draw-activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL and RDL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive Security Protection Functions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 71.9* 53* 19mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 700mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: SOLUS 0.9ohm Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower Range: Max 20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2.5ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-c Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK Solus G-BOX Kit Package List:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x SMOK SOLUS G-BOX Device(700mAh)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x SOLUS Meshed 0.9ohm Pod(2.5ml)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41574754385975,"sku":"20","price":3750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-solus-g-box-kit.jpg?v=1743120626","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-solus-g-box-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




